sequenceDiagram
    actor S as 系统任务
    participant R as BookingRunner
    participant L as LibraryRooms
    participant H as 慧图平台

    S->>R: 每天 20:00 后台执行
    R->>R: 评估后天星期策略
    R->>L: 解析房间 query 与 UID
    L->>H: GET /Space/Category/list
    H-->>L: 房间类型
    L->>H: GET /Seat/Index/searchSeats?query
    H-->>L: space_category
    L->>H: POST /Seat/Index/searchSeats
    H-->>L: 楼层与座位布局
    R->>R: 目标时刻前 5 秒预温完成
    R->>H: POST /Seat/Index/bookSeats + Api-Token
    H-->>R: CODE / MESSAGE / DATA
    R->>H: GET /Seat/Index/myBookingList?fromType=web
    H-->>R: 预约列表
    R->>R: 复核 seatNum/time/duration
    R-->>S: 成功/失败/退出码
